examples:
on tebex command:
	if command contains "give":
		cancel event

on join:
	if player has pending tebex commands:
		send "Your purchase is on its way!" to player

on command /cart:
	create a tebex basket link for {_packages::*} for player and store it in {_link}
	send {_link} to player

on tebex command:
	if player is not online:
		mark the tebex command as unexecuted
